# WARNING currently still experimental stage

# Example program calling libpfasst to solve the 1D advection-diffusion equation
#   This example uses a parallel-sweep (time-time parallel) 

    u_t + v*u_x = nu*u_xx

# Building the Tutorial:
Call `$ make` in the ../LIBPFASST/Tutorials/EX3_adv_diff.

# Running the Tutorial
Call `$ mpirun -n 2 ./main.exe sdc_diag.nml` for parallel single level SDC with diagonal sweep
Make sure that **n = nnodes-1** otherwise diagonal sweeper will throw an error.

